flowchart LR
    U[User] --> A[Paste UGC URLs\nTikTok, Reels, Shorts]
    A --> B[Video Downloader\nyt-dlp service]
    B --> C[Multimodal Analyzer\nGemini extraction]
    C --> D[Structured Candidate POIs\nname, vibe, priority, media cues]
    D --> E[Geocoding Layer\nTavily + Nominatim]
    E --> F[Itinerary Builder\nclustering + day assignment]
    F --> G[Trip Object\nPydantic schema]
    G --> H[Local JSON Persistence\nbackend/data/trips]
    H --> I[FastAPI Response]
    I --> J[Frontend Trip View\nmap + day cards + chat]

    C -. malformed output fallback .-> D
    E -. low-confidence geocode .-> K[Fallback location handling\nmanual prompt or default coords]
    K --> F

    J --> L[Chat Agent Request]
    L --> M[LangGraph Orchestrator]
    M --> J
